fusion-cvar-description-heat-scale = Changes how much energy it takes to heat/cool a FusionMixture. 64x means gases heat up and cool down 64x faster than real life.
fusion-cvar-description-mass-scale = Changes the matter consumption rate of fusion reactions. 4x means it takes 4x more matter to make the same amount of energy.
fusion-cvar-description-energy-scale = Changes the amount of energy created per fusion reaction.

fusion-reactor-cvar-description-mass-destruction = If the fusion reactor is allowed to generate a station-ending explosion.
fusion-reactor-cvar-description-delay-stage3 = Number of seconds the reactor will sit in stage 3 before exploding or continuing to stage 4.
fusion-reactor-cvar-description-delay-stage4 = Number of seconds the reactor will sit in stage 4 before exploding.
fusion-reactor-cvar-description-explosion-min = Minimum explosive power of a fusion reactor meltdown.
fusion-reactor-cvar-description-explosion-max = Maximum explosive power of a fusion reactor meltdown when fusion_reactor.allow_mass_destruction is false.
fusion-reactor-cvar-description-explosion-max-destruction = Maximum explosive power of a fusion reactor meltdown when fusion_reactor.allow_mass_destruction is true.
